  "Asigna papeles a tus aliados para que **actúen**. Los **puntos de apoyo** entre las unidades elegidas aumentarán, y quizá obtengas **recompensas**.": "**Perform** in a play with your choice of allies. The cast's **Support Points will increase**, and you can **earn rewards** such as gold.",
