  "Ataca con garras afiladas o la cola.": "An attack using sharp claws or a tail.",
  "Ataca con garras de bestia demoniaca del inframundo.": "A clawing attack from a Demonic Beast of the underworld.",
  "Ataca con garras de dragón. Puede golpear a todos los enemigos al alcance simultáneamente.": "An attack with massive dragon claws. Can hit all foes within attack range simultaneously.",
  "Ataca con garras de las que emana el poder del inframundo.": "An attack with claws surging with the underworld's power.",
