  "Carne de porcelio": "Louse Meat",
  "Carne de ruc": "Rukh Meat",
  "Carne de yarco": "Yarc Meat",
  "Carne del inframundo": "Dead Flesh",
  "Carne dulce. Cocinada a fuego lento, adquiere un sabor sorprendentemente refinado.": "A sweet, gamy meat. Simmering it well brings forth a surprisingly refined flavor.",
  "Carne magra de sabor fresco y ligero. Queda insípida si se pasa de cocción.": "A lean meat with a fresh, airy flavor. Overcooking it will likely drain it of its flavor.",
  "Carne oscura con fuerte aroma a sangre. Es dura pero fácil de masticar.": "A dark meat with the potent scent of blood. It is firm yet surprisingly easy to bite through.",
  "Carne palpitante": "Pulsating Flesh",
  "Carne pálida y fibrosa de sabor similar a un crustáceo. Pocas partes de este animal son comestibles.": "A pale, fibrous meat with a similar flavor to crustaceans. Surprisingly few parts of this animal are edible.",
  "Carne rojiza muy nutritiva. Mucha gente opina que casa bien con una gran variedad de platos.": "A nutrient-rich meat, known for its bright-red color. Many agree it pairs excellently with most dishes.",
  "Carne sabrosa y de regusto agripicante. Apenas desprende olor.": "A richly flavored meat with no defining odor. It has a slightly sour and spicy aftertaste.",
  "Carne sabrosa y rica en grasa. Se dice que las mejores tajadas las dan las hembras.": "A rich, flavorful meat, known for its succulence. It is widely agreed that females produce the best cuts.",
  "Carne tierna de peculiar aroma. Suele prepararse con hierbas frescas.": "A tender, gamy meat known for its unique aroma. It is commonly prepared with fresh herbs.",
