  "Complejo cuadro floral. Es parte de una serie creada por un gran artista. Para amantes del arte.": "An intricate painting of flowers. Part of a series by a master artist. Primarily enjoyed by painting lovers.",
  "Completa misiones del tablón.": "Do subquests from the bulletin board.",
