  "Condiciones victoria": "Win Conditions",
  "Condimento con sabor umami preparado en ciudades costeras. Ideal para aficionados a la cocina.": "A salty, umami-flavored fish sauce typically made in waterside towns. Primarily enjoyed by those who love to cook.",
  "Condimento con un intenso sabor umami conseguido al mezclar especias picantes con marisco.": "A condiment with a strong umami flavor. Made by mixing spices and seafood. Primarily enjoyed by those who love to cook.",
  "Conduce a Fortuna hasta Kunlun.": "Returns to the village of Kunlun as Fortuna's guide.",
  "Confieso que hay cada chicarrón en Dagsion que... Aunque ninguno tan apuesto como mi pichurri, claro.": "Sometimes the guys in Dagsion turn my head, but... No! Sweetie's the one for me!",
