  "Deidad": "God",
  "Deja la política en manos de su padre y viaja a Dagda.": "Leaving politics to his father, travels to Dagda to learn its culture.",
  "Del trío de rocas, dicen que esta favorece con su bendición las despedidas cordiales.": "One of a trio of rocks. Its blessings are said to facilitate amicable partings.",
  "Del trío de rocas, dicen que esta fomenta nuevas oportunidades para crear vínculos.": "One of a trio of rocks. Its blessings are said to create new opportunities for connection.",
  "Del trío de rocas, dicen que esta, con su gracia, conserva y refuerza las relaciones.": "One of a trio of rocks. Its blessings are said to preserve and strengthen love.",
  "Deliciosos caramelos hechos a base de mijo desértico cristalizado en azúcar. Perfectos para amantes de las golosinas.": "High-quality candy made from crystallizing desert millet into sugar. Primarily enjoyed by those who love sweets.",
