  "Derrotar a un enemigo con un golpe crítico restaura algunos PV a la unidad.": "After defeating a foe with a critical attack, restores a little HP to unit.",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Agu +3 hasta la siguiente fase.": "After defeating a foe, grants Prt+3 until unit's next phase.",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Gol +3 (máx. +30) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants Hit+3 until the end of the map. (Max +30)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Mov +1 (máx. +3) hasta el final del turno siguiente.": "After defeating a foe, grants Mov+1 through the end of the next turn. (Max +3)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga PV máximos +2 (máx. +10) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants max HP+2 until the end of the map. (Max +10)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Sue +1 (máx. +10) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants Lck+1 until the end of the map. (Max +10)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Sue +2 (máx. +10) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants Lck+2 until the end of the map. (Max +10)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Vel +1 (máx. +10) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants Spd+1 until the end of the map. (Max +10)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo otorga Vel +2 (máx. +10) hasta el final de la batalla.": "After defeating a foe, grants Spd+2 until the end of the map. (Max +10)",
  "Derrotar a un enemigo puede restaurar todos los PV de la unidad. Probabilidad = (Sue ÷ 2) %.": "After defeating a foe, unit recovers HP equal to max HP. Trigger % = Lck ÷ 2.",
