  "Diversas criaturas habitan esta planicie envuelta en nieblas que reducen la visión.": "Plain cloaked in fog, making visibility difficult. It is home to a variety of creatures.",
  "Diversas criaturas viven en este arrecife próximo al pueblo de pescadores de Fina.": "A reef near the fishing village of Fina, home to a variety of creatures.",
