  "Joven gladiador": "Young Gladiator",
  "Joven lancera capaz de plantar cara a todo el mundo y portar cualquier armadura, por pesada que sea.": "A strong young woman who can stand up to any foe. However heavy the armor, she wears it lightly.",
  "Joven luchadora que compensa su poca experiencia en combate con un enorme potencial de crecimiento.": "An inexperienced fighter. What she lacks in battle experience, she makes up for with growth potential.",
  "Joven mercenario que jamás se separa de su fiel corcel y aprovecha su gran movilidad en combate.": "A young mercenary who takes to battle with his trusty steed. Uses his mobility to great advantage.",
  "Joven muchacha de gran corazón, capaz de plantar cara al enemigo y sanar a sus aliados.": "A fiercely kind young woman who is proficient in battling foes as well as healing allies.",
  "Joven sin recuerdos": "Girl with No Memories",
