  "Juguetes que los niños usan para hacer simples trucos de magia. Para quienes gusten de lo espiritual.": "A collection of items children often use to perform simple magic tricks. Primarily enjoyed by those who appreciate spirituality.",
  "Juicio inminente": "Pass Judgment",
  "Juicio inminente+": "Pass Judgment+",
  "Junto a Aurora, su madre, cuida de Castor en su lecho de muerte.": "With his mother, Aurora, cares for Castor on his deathbed.",
  "Junto a Theodora, Dietrich derrota a Dagda, que se había transformado en dragón y es sacrificado para conjurar el inframundo y revivir a Balor, el dios demoniaco. Entonces aparece una figura de blanco que salva a Dietrich del infierno que se ha desatado en Dagsion.": "Alongside Theodora, Dietrich defeats the dragon Dagda the Great, but the god is sacrificed to manifest the underworld and revive the demon god Balor. A figure in white appears, saving Dietrich from certain death, and Dietrich breaks free from the hellscape of Dagsion.",
  "Juntos": "Hearts as One",
  "Jurah": "Jurah",
  "Jyoppa": "Jyoppa",
  "Jóvenes bandoleros de la aldea de Yaaman.": "Youths from Yaaman village— rogues to the last.",
  "Jóvenes cazadores de una localidad llamada Regia.": "Young hunters from a village called Regia.",
  "Jóvenes de Ribeira": "Children of Ribeira",
  "Jóvenes mercenarios y augures de la aldea de Twalinn.": "Young mercenaries from a village called Twalinn, all diviners.",
  "Kalla": "Kalla",
  "Kalla le concede el apodo de Rosa Azul de Caelus.": "Is named the Blue Rose of Caelus by Kalla.",
  "Kalla le encarga que investigue en secreto la matanza de Cydonia.": "On a secret mission from Kalla, investigates the Cydonia Massacre.",
  "Kalla, papel que interpreta …, lamenta la pérdida de su querido hijo Cohen.": "Kalla, played by …, mourns the loss of Cohen, her sorely missed son.",
