  "Lucha para proteger Saramis de las huestes del inframundo.": "Fights to protect Saramis from the underworld armies.",
  "Lucha para proteger a los suyos.": "Fights to protect his kin.",
  "Lucha para proteger a su familia de las huestes del inframundo.": "Fights to protect her family from the armies of the underworld.",
  "Lucha para proteger la tierra que amaba su difunto marido.": "Fights to protect the land her late spouse loved.",
  "Lucha por el trono de Saramis": "Scramble for the Throne",
  "Lucha por proteger a su reino de las huestes del inframundo.": "Battles to protect the kingdom of Arago from the underworld army.",
  "Lucha por salvar a su pueblo. Hábil esquivando y en las artes marciales basadas en los flujos de energía.": "A young Mediator fighting to save her people. Skilled in energy-flow-based martial arts and dodging.",
  "Lucha y sacrificio": "Sacrifice and Strife",
  "Luchadora que lanza puñetazos rápidos y potentes. Se concentra en combate para esquivar los ataques.": "A fighter whose punches are fast and fierce. She can avoid attacks as her focus increases during battle.",
  "Luchadores con escasa experiencia.": "Fighters with little experience.",
  "Luchadores de Alecto, la metrópolis del mar.": "Brawlers from Alecto, the ocean metropolis.",
  "Luchadores que derriban a los enemigos con una ráfaga de golpes.": "Brawlers who can knock out foes with a flurry of blows.",
  "Luchar a muerte, comida de su tierra, ser mujeriego.": "Fighting to the death, food from his hometown, womanizing.",
  "Luchar no se me da mal. A ver si algún día te hago una demostración.": "I'm confident in my abilities in battle. I should show you what I can do sometime!",
  "Luchar, Yu Phas, ver prosperar a su pueblo.": "Fighting, Yu Phas, seeing her people thrive.",
  "Luchar, cosas que dan miedo, oscuridad, fantasmas.": "Fighting, scary things, the dark, ghosts.",
  "Lucharás contra un grupo variado, pero la estrategia de ataques lejanos debería bastar para dar buena cuenta de tus rivales. Y, si portas armas de bronce, mejor que mejor.": "A slightly more varied crowd, I see. Still, bring the usual bows and magic to have a less difficult time. You'll find that equipping bronze weapons will be especially helpful.",
  "Lucharás en terreno difícil y ante una legión de enemigos, así que prepárate a conciencia para la batalla. Sugiero que eches mano de tropas versadas en la magia negra.": "The terrain is complex and your foes are legion. Be ready to deal with any and all circumstances. If pressed, I'd say you'd do well to have someone skilled with black magic.",
  "Lucidez guerrera": "Warrior's Clarity",
