  "Lujo, mentirosos, irresponsables, gente ruidosa.": "Luxury, liars, people who are irresponsible or loud.",
  "Lujosa caja llena de especias poco comunes. Perfecta para entusiastas de la comida picante.": "Extremely rare spices packed in a luxurious presentation box. Primarily enjoyed by spicy-food lovers.",
