  "Mercenaria con grandes dotes defensivas que, además, no suele fallar ni un contrataque.": "A mercenary leader who specializes in defense. Returns attacks as highly accurate counterattacks.",
  "Mercenaria de primer nivel que aprovecha su gran velocidad para lanzar ataques certeros.": "A sterling mercenary with proven skill. She seizes the advantage and raises precision with great speed.",
