  "Mina de Valhalla": "Valhalla Mine",
  "Mina de las montañas de Cydonia cuya existencia se mantiene en secreto.": "A mine dug in the mountains of Cydonia, kept secret by those behind it.",
  "Mineral común y abundante en todo el continente. Indispensable para la forja.": "A common ore found throughout the land. Known as a cornerstone in smithing materials.",
  "Mineral cristalino que reluce con hermosos destellos azules. Hay que entregárselo a Olympia.": "A crystal with a captivating blue sparkle. Offer it to Olympia.",
  "Mineral de gran calidad extraído en minas de hierro. Célebre por su bajo grado de carbono e impurezas.": "A high-quality ore, often found in iron mines. Known for its low rate of carbon and other impurities.",
  "Mineral de hierro con aspecto leñoso. Se emplea para forjar armas de gran calidad.": "An iron ore with a wood-grain pattern. Often used in smithing to forge high-quality weapons.",
  "Mineral de peculiar aspecto. Cristaliza tras absorber magia durante milenios.": "A mineral that has crystallized by absorbing magic over millennia. It is known for its distinct shape.",
  "Mineral descubierto en el monte Ouranos. Marca la posición del sol.": "A mineral named after Mount Ouranos where it was discovered. It can determine the sun's position.",
  "Mineral escaso que solo se halla en la caverna de Nemea. Extraerlo es sumamente peligroso.": "A very rare ore found only in Nemea Cavern. Mining it is extremely dangerous.",
  "Mineral escaso y de brillo dorado. El Templo lo regula debido a su capacidad para absorber la magia.": "A rare mineral with a gold sparkle. It can store magic within itself and is strictly regulated by the temples.",
  "Mineral escaso y de brillo pálido. El Templo lo regula debido a su extraordinaria resistencia.": "A rare mineral with a pale sparkle. Extremely durable and strictly regulated by the temples.",
  "Mineral escaso; se dice que es la esencia del alma de un guerrero que no llegó al inframundo.": "A rare mineral, said to be the lost essence of a fallen warrior whose soul failed to reach the underworld.",
  "Mineral que absorbe y almacena las toxinas del aire. Peligroso si no se extrae con cuidado.": "An ore that absorbs airborne toxins and stores them inside. It can be dangerous unless mined carefully.",
  "Mineral raro que se encuentra en cuevas cercanas al océano. Alberga el poder de los mares.": "A rare ore that forms in caves near the ocean. It contains the power of the sea.",
  "Mineral raro que se forma en zonas oscuras y silenciosas. Alberga la luz de la luna.": "A rare ore that forms in dark, quiet areas. It contains the radiance of the moon.",
  "Mineral raro que se origina en cuevas con abundantes corrientes de aire. Alberga el poder del viento.": "A rare ore that forms in caves with relentless air currents. It contains the power of the wind.",
  "Mineral raro que se origina en zonas bañadas por la luz solar. Alberga el poder del sol.": "A rare ore that forms in areas that are frequently bathed in sunlight. It contains the brilliance of the sun.",
  "Mineral raro que se origina en zonas donde caen relámpagos. Alberga el poder del trueno.": "A rare ore that forms in areas with frequent lightning strikes. It contains the power of lightning.",
  "Mineral raro que se origina en zonas frías y penumbrosas. Emite un pálido brillo azul.": "A rare ore that occasionally forms in dark, cold places. It glows with a pale-blue light.",
  "Mineral resistente que solo se halla en zonas concretas. Al chocarlo con el metal indicado, saltan chispas.": "A very durable mineral, only found in specific places. It creates sparks when struck with the right metal.",
  "Minerales": "Ore",
