  "Mmm... Nunca he visto un pájaro con una mirada tan viva.": "Your eyes... I've never seen a bird with eyes like yours.",
  "Mmm... Te veo un poco despeluchado. Así te costará volar. Quédate quieto, que te ayudo.": "Hm. These disheveled feathers must make it hard to fly. I'll straighten them for you.",
  "Mochila de calidad": "Sturdy Rucksack",
  "Mochila de cuero resistente y de gran capacidad. Ideal para cualquier viajero.": "A durable leather bag that holds far more than one would expect. Primarily enjoyed by travel enthusiasts.",
