  "Nace en una prestigiosa casa de Saramis.": "Born into a prestigious house in the kingdom of Saramis.",
  "Nací y me crie en el fuerte de Lyoshan. Si vuelas por allí, ¡ten cuidado con los bandidos!": "I was born and raised at Lyoshan Fort. If you ever go there, watch out for all the ruffians!",
  "Nada bueno sucede al aislarnos por orgullo. Ese camino conduce a la extinción.": "We must not isolate ourselves out of pride. That way is death. Do not forget this.",
  "Nada en particular.": "None.",
  "Nada importa más": "A Father's Request and a Daughter's Wish",
  "Nadie que cae en este pozo de arenas movedizas sale con vida.": "A pit formed in the quicksand. Anyone who gets sucked in will not come out alive.",
  "Nasshim era muy protector y se portaba bien conmigo. Lo echo de menos...": "Nasshim used to take care of me. He was so nice. I still think about him sometimes...",
  "Nasshim y los demás le enseñan a actuar y a luchar.": "Learns how to perform and fight from Nasshim and the others.",
  "Nathan": "Nathan",
  "Nathan y Creek": "Nathan and Creek",
  "Navega con rumbo a una tierra legendaria por sus combates cruentos.": "Boards a ship to head for a land famed for its brutality.",
  "Navegación": "Navigate",
  "Navegar, piratería.": "Riding on ships, pirating.",
  "Necesario": "Required",
  "Necesitarás **al menos un ingrediente** para poder descansar. La **cantidad de PV y magia que recuperes** dependerá del **número y tipo de ingredientes** usados.": "A **minimum of one ingredient** is required to rest. The **amount recovered depends** on the **number and type of ingredients** used.",
  "Necesitarás **al menos una planta** para crear el cultivo. Podrás **recoger la cosecha** **al cabo de varios turnos**.": "You'll **need one plant** in order to create a field. Once you Farm, you can **harvest** your crop **after several turns**.",
  "Necesitarás clases capaces de sortear obstáculos de baja altura para romper las filas enemigas. Y también tropas resistentes para soportar los embates incesantes del rival.": "A class capable of bypassing low obstacles could be handy for breaching the enemy lines. Your foes' assault will rain down furiously, so bring hardy and resistant units to withstand it.",
  "Necesitas al menos un ingrediente.": "You must have at least one ingredient to use this.",
  "Necesito distraerme y no pensar en el futuro. Es un tema que me genera ansiedad.": "When I think about the future, I always end up worrying about stuff I can't do anything about.",
