  "Nos gustaría que lady Ultand fuese nuestra reina, aunque haya quien se niegue a aceptar una soberana de baja cuna.": "We hope to take Lady Ultand as our queen, though some consider her rank in society too low for us...",
  "Nos recuerdas a las ánimas de nuestro hogar. ¿Por qué será?": "You remind us of the spirits of our homeland. Perhaps we are connected somehow.",
