  "Nubes de tormenta": "The Storm Comes",
  "Nuestro plato favorito siempre ha sido el marisco. Estaría bien saborear contigo otras delicias de Dagda.": "We have enjoyed seafood since our earliest days and would like to savor Dagdan specialties with you.",
  "Nuestros enemigos son cada vez más poderosos... Procura que todas las tropas alcancen una clase Suprema. El miasma afectará a la puntería, pero quizá haya forma de aprovecharlo.": "Our foes are growing tougher. Are you ensuring your allies reach Master classes? The miasma on this battlefield affects one's aim...but perhaps we can turn that to our advantage.",
