  "Nunca he visto un pájaro como tú.": "You seem...different from other birds.",
  "Nunca se debe descuidar la imagen. ¿Tú te acicalas las plumas de vez en cuando?": "Caring for one's personal appearance is crucial. Are you taking good care of yourself?",
  "Nunca sin corcel": "With My Steed",
  "Nunca traes compañía. ¿No te abruma la soledad de este vasto mundo?": "You always seem to be alone. Don't you get lonely out there in the world, all by yourself?",
