  "Obús del inframundo": "Blackfire",
  "Ocealito": "Sea-Star Stone",
  "Ocealito es un mineral raro que se encuentra en Cueva de Nowah. ¡Quién sabe lo que podrías Refinar con él!": "I hear there's a rare ore called Sea-Star Stone to be had at Nowah's Cave. Aren't you curious to know what you could Refine with it?",
