  "Ocultistas": "Secret-Art Wielders",
  "Odio a las serpientes... Dime, si ves alguna, ¿podrías espantarla por mí?": "I can't stand snakes. If there was a snake here, you would chase it away, right?",
  "Odio sentirme atado. ¿Y tú?": "I detest restraints. And you?",
