  "Otras estructuras": "Subsurface Zones",
  "Otrora un instrumento de navegación inestimable, hoy maldice a quien lo porte. Otorga Mag +3.": "Once a priceless tool of adventure, this compass will curse anyone who defies its master. Grants Mag+3.",
  "Otros": "Other",
  "Otros mercenarios empiezan a llamarlo Guzran el Inmortal.": "Becomes known among other mercenaries as the Unkillable Guzran.",
  "Ouranolito": "Ouranotite",
  "Oye hablar de la Providencia y no tarda en sumarse a la causa.": "Hears about the Promised One and joins up quickly.",
  "Oye, tú no eres un pájaro normal, ¿verdad?": "Uh, there's some kinda weird bird here.",
  "Oye, tú vives en el bosque, ¿verdad? ¿Y... has visto algún fantasma?": "You live in the forest, right? So tell me...how do you feel about ghosts?",
  "Oye, ¿tienes hambre?": "Hey, you gettin' enough to eat?",
  "Oye... ¿no te aburre mi compañía?": "Um... Doesn't being with me...bore you?",
  "Ozin me enseñó a defenderme sola, así que me entreno para que no se preocupe por mí.": "Ozin taught me how to defend myself. Now I want to be strong enough, so he doesn't have to worry!",
  "PC": "LP",
  "PV": "HP",
