  "Paraíso de Zenzele": "Zenzele's Paradise",
  "Pareces acostumbrado a la gente.": "You seem to be quite well-acclimated to people.",
  "Pareces muy espabilado para ser un pájaro. Podrías ejercer como la mascota de la empresa.": "You seem far sharper than the average bird. How would you like to be a pet at the company?",
  "Paredes sucias, perder el tiempo, personas ignorantes.": "Stains on the wall, things that waste her time, ignorant people.",
