  "Pez abisal": "Bedfish",
  "Pez acero": "Steelfish",
  "Pez adaptado a las aguas de mares y lagos. Habita las zonas más profundas, por lo que se capturan poquísimos ejemplares.": "A rare fish found in both seas and lakes. Because it lives in extremely deep waters, it is rarely caught.",
  "Pez capaz de sobrevivir en aguas contaminadas. Se aconseja limpiarlo bien antes de cocinarlo.": "A resilient freshwater fish that can thrive in polluted habitats. Best purged of mud before cooking.",
  "Pez capaz de sobrevivir tanto en agua dulce como salada. De escamas doradas y carne dulce.": "A sweet fish with beautiful, golden scales. It can survive in both freshwater and saltwater habitats.",
  "Pez capaz de sobrevivir tanto en agua dulce como salada. Sus escamas son blancas y plateadas.": "A salty fish with silvery-white scales. It can survive in both freshwater and saltwater habitats.",
  "Pez común del mar de Lir. Se le suele ver agazapado en el lecho marino, siempre ojo avizor.": "A common fish found in the Lir Sea. It is often spotted beneath the seabed, peeking out curiously.",
  "Pez cuyo cuerpo plano recuerda a un escudo. Su carne desecada se considera una exquisitez.": "A fish with a flat body resembling a shield. Its dried form is considered a delicacy.",
  "Pez dagdano de agua dulce. De cuerpo pequeño y plano, puede comerse con o sin espinas.": "A common Dagdan freshwater fish. It is small and flat with bones that can be removed or eaten whole.",
  "Pez de agua dulce y escamas inusualmente gruesas. Se esconde en aguas de corrientes lentas.": "A freshwater fish known for its incredibly thick scales. It hides in areas with relatively low currents.",
  "Pez del paraíso": "Paradise Fish",
  "Pez dulcespada": "Sugar Marlin",
  "Pez espada de Garla": "Garla Marlin",
  "Pez grande y carnívoro de agua salada. Su carne gruesa y sabrosa puede cocinarse de varias maneras.": "A large, carnivorous open-sea fish. Its meat is thick and rich, and can be prepared in many ways.",
  "Pez grande y carnívoro de agua salada. Tiene un peculiar patrón de cabeza y vive solo en ciertas zonas.": "A large, carnivorous open-sea fish known for the pattern on its head. It only resides in certain areas.",
  "Pez luna": "Moonfish",
  "Pez migratorio cuyo morro termina en una punta corta. Su carne dulce casa bien con muchos platos.": "A migratory fish with a short beak. Its meat is thick and sweet. It pairs well with many dishes.",
  "Pez mítico que solo vive en algunos lagos. Las leyendas hablan de su brillo bajo la luz de la luna.": "A mythical fish that only lives in certain lakes. Legends spin tales of its radiant glow on moonlit nights.",
  "Pez poco común y de gran valor nutritivo. Habita mares agitados.": "A rare fish with extremely high nutritional value. It prefers to live in rough seas.",
  "Pez que habita en el mar de Lir. De sabor distintivo, solo los chefs expertos saben cómo cocinarlo.": "A fish found in the Lir Sea. Known for its distinct flavor, it can only be prepared properly by expert chefs.",
  "Pez que habita en el mar de Lir. Pequeño pero feroz, es capaz de romper las redes de pesca.": "A fish found widely in the Lir Sea. It is small but fiercely aggressive, often tearing through fishing nets.",
  "Pez que habita en la zona profunda de las corrientes de Pasha. Su carne grasa y sabrosa colma el estómago.": "A deep-sea fish found in the Pasha Currents. Incredibly fatty and delicious, but fills the stomach quickly.",
  "Pez que habita en lagos grandes. Desprende un olor penetrante y su preparación requiere práctica.": "A freshwater fish found in large lakes. It has a powerful odor and requires expert preparation.",
  "Pez que migra por corrientes frías. Conserva su sabor suave sin importar cómo se cocine.": "A migratory fish that travels along cold currents. Its mild flavor is consistent despite how it's cooked.",
  "Pez que solo se halla en algunos lagos. Su singular sabor puede volverse adictivo para algunos.": "A very rare fish found only in certain lakes. Its unique taste can become addicting for some.",
  "Pez que suele habitar en lagos. En honor a su elegancia, se le suele llamar «la reina del lago».": "A freshwater fish commonly found in lakes. With its elegance, it is often called the Queen of the Lake.",
  "Pez que suele habitar en lagos. Su carne se estropea rápidamente, por lo que suele venderse desecado.": "A freshwater fish often found in lakes. It spoils quickly, so it is typically sold in a processed form.",
