  "Seda brillante con un acabado negro muy atractivo. Para entusiastas de la moda.": "Glossy silk thread with a pitch-black finish that draws you in. Primarily enjoyed by fashion lovers.",
  "Seda negra oriental": "Eastern Black Silk",
