  "Serpiente": "Serpent Formation",
  "Serpiente suma": "Supreme Serpent",
  "Serpiente+": "Serpent Formation+",
  "Servicio divino": "Divine Service",
  "Servicio grupal": "Group Service",
  "Servir": "Service",
  "Servir en el templo de Aurora, patrullar.": "Serving Aurora's temple, patrolling.",
  "Servir en el templo de una divinidad concreta durante su día sagrado aumenta los tributos.": "Service at a god's temple on their holy day will always award extra tribute.",
  "Servir en los templos": "Temple Service",
  "Servir en templos otorga bendiciones.": "Service can earn a god's favor.",
  "Sería interesante entrenar mi dominio de la lanza contigo. ¿Te sientes capaz de esquivar mis ataques?": "I have considered training my spear technique against you. Surely you can avoid my blows.",
  "Set completo de materiales esenciales para zurcir y fáciles de usar. Ideal para aficionados a la moda.": "A complete set of sewing essentials that are incredibly easy to use. Primarily enjoyed by fashion lovers.",
  "Set completo de utensilios para cocinar al aire libre. Un regalo ideal para expertos culinarios.": "A complete set of cooking utensils designed for outdoor use. Primarily enjoyed by those who love to cook.",
  "Set de cocina de campo": "Outdoor Cooking Set",
  "Set de cuchillas de Da Mina y de uso fácil. Ideal para amantes de la artesanía.": "A set of easy-to-use carving knives from Da Mina. Primarily enjoyed by crafting enthusiasts.",
  "Set de cuidado ecuestre": "Horse-Grooming Kit",
  "Set de herramientas que ayudan a mantener arcos. Indispensable para aficionados a la arquería.": "A collection of tools that help one maintain their bow. Primarily enjoyed by archers.",
  "Set de magia": "Magic-Trick Set",
  "Set de pintura": "Pack of Pastels",
  "Seta sureña que no suele cultivarse. A los kusarik les encanta.": "A southern mushroom that is rarely farmed. It is a known favorite of the kusarik.",
  "Seteth": "Seteth",
  "Señor de la Llama Cai": "Flame Lord Cai",
