  "Tal vez debería adornar uno de mis proyectos con plumas bonitas.": "I'm good at crafts. I ought to try making something with bird feathers, maybe.",
  "Tal vez me atraes tanto porque, al igual que me pasa con él, me cuesta descifrar en qué piensas.": "Maybe the reason I'm drawn to you is because, like that person, you're hard to grasp...",
  "Talentos": "Talents",
  "Talimun": "Talimun",
  "Talimun me ha salvado la vida en más de un sentido, aunque siempre me salpiquen sus desventuras.": "Talimun has saved me in far more ways than one. Attending his misadventures is a small price to pay.",
  "Talimun y Lind": "Talimun and Lind",
