  "Vara Invocadora": "Beckoning Branch",
  "Vara de Aaron": "Aaron's Rod",
  "Vara imbuida de poder oscuro. Otorga Mag +4 y Hab +4.": "A rod imbued with dark power. Grants Mag/Dex+4.",
  "Variedad común de grano que precisa mucha agua para crecer, por lo que se cultiva cerca de ríos.": "A widely used grain. It requires ample water to grow, so it is farmed in areas with large rivers.",
  "Variedad de magonius que compensa su menor poder mágico con una mayor agilidad.": "A rare ornius imbued with magic, albeit less than the normal variant. Its agility makes it a popular mount.",
  "Variedad de ornius más fuerte y resistente.": "Though it looks like a regular ornius, this variant has much more strength and stamina.",
  "Variedad de té negro de Creusa, apreciada por su color y fragancia. Olympia lo espera ansiosa.": "Rare black tea from Creusa, known for its color and fragrance. Get this over to Olympia right away.",
  "Variedad muy peculiar de ornius mágico. Se piensa que la fuente de su poder está en la alimentación.": "A rare ornius imbued with magic. It's hypothesized that this ability comes from its diet.",
  "Variedad poco común del monte Orgus y de fuerte sabor. Ideal para amantes de los matices amargos.": "A rare, strong coffee from Mount Orgus. Primarily enjoyed by those who love coffee.",
  "Varita de Fortuna": "Fortuna's Wand",
  "Vas a enfrentarte a soldados de gran capacidad defensiva, pero poco acostumbrados a lidiar con la magia negra. Las hachas también pueden ayudar a quebrar sus armaduras.": "You'll be facing hardy soldiers with thick defenses, but they won't be prepared for your black magic. An axe or two may also help to split their heavy armor.",
  "Vas a medirte a enemigos que atacarán a distancia con magia y arcos, de modo que deberías desplegar tropas capaces de soportar ese tipo de tácticas.": "You'll face many foes who attack from a distance, using bows and magic both. Best to bring allies highly resistant to such tactics in order to bear the brunt.",
  "Vas a vértelas con un rival de tamaño imponente. Necesitarás tropas que ataquen con magia y con armas de proyectiles, mas no descuides otras clases para adaptarte a toda circunstancia.": "A large foe will prove troublesome here. Magic and bow users can't go amiss when dealing with changing circumstances. A variety of allies will help you to adapt to the flow of battle.",
  "Vasalla de la Providencia": "Promised One's Retainer",
  "Vasallos sin fuerza de voluntad, señores que no velan por su pueblo.": "Rulers who don't watch out for their people, spineless attendants.",
  "Vastas planicies cercanas al infame estrecho de Bran.": "Vast plains not far from the notorious Bran Narrows.",
  "Vate": "Ovate",
  "Vaticino un rival imponente, pero con ciertos puntos débiles. Usa la magia contra las unidades acorazadas, ataca cuerpo a cuerpo a los arqueros... y busca refuerzos, si es posible.": "The forces arrayed against you are many, but all will have their weak points—magic for armored foes, melee for archers, and so forth. Any reinforcements will be welcome additions.",
  "Ve a la celda de Bertrand.": "Head to Bertrand's cell.",
  "Ve a la celda de Castor.": "Head to Castor's cell.",
