  "Vegetal amargo que crece en zonas de baja altitud. Calma la mente al ser ingerido.": "A bitter vegetable that thrives in low altitudes. It is known to soothe the mind when ingested.",
  "Vegetal comestible muy popular que no suele cultivarse, pero cuyas semillas tienen usos culinarios.": "A popular vegetable. While it is rarely farmed, its buds are harvested for food.",
  "Vegetal de sabor áspero que crece en zonas montañosas. Su fruto se suele desecar para cocinarlo.": "A pungent vegetable that grows in mountainous areas. Its fruit is often dried and used in cooking.",
  "Vegetal que crece en zonas norteñas y tiene una raíz roja y esférica. Pierde picor al calentarse.": "A vegetable found in northern areas. Known for its spherical red root, it loses spiciness when heated.",
  "Vegetal que prolifera principalmente en las llanuras de Melias. Su sabor es ligeramente amargo.": "A distinct vegetable that grows mainly in the Melias-region plains. Known for its mild, slightly bitter taste.",
  "Vegetal suntuoso de Ogmios que crece cerca del mar. Se comercializa desde hace relativamente poco.": "A luxury vegetable from the Ogmios region, found near the sea. It is fairly new to public markets.",
  "Vegetal típico de climas cálidos. Es tan picante que puede irritar las manos de quienes lo cultivan.": "A vegetable that thrives in heat. Its spiciness can even cause irritation to the hands when harvested.",
  "Vegetales": "Vegetable",
  "Vegetales en conserva que se cosechan a lo largo del año. Buen regalo para amantes de la verdura.": "Potted vegetables that can be harvested throughout the year. Primarily enjoyed by vegetable lovers.",
  "Vegetales fermentados en escabeche durante meses. Regalo ideal para gourmets vegetarianos.": "Vegetables fermented in brine for several months. Primarily enjoyed by vegetable lovers.",
