  "Dar bajas a [[PID_ムウ]] desde el primer combate": "Give kills to [[PID_ムウ]] from the first battle",
  "Dar bajas a [[PID_ムウ]] desde el primer combate: Signos de madurez suma +20 a todos sus crecimientos.": "Give kills to [[PID_ムウ]] from the first battle: Signs of Growth adds +20 to all her growths.",
  "Dar las Piedras de cadena a un tanque de Def/Res alta, que recupera PC mientras aguanta; en mazmorras no hay convoy.": "Give the Linking Rocks to a high-Def/Res tank, which recovers LP while holding out; there is no convoy in dungeons.",
  "Dar un regalo a los invitados en el capítulo anterior para que acepten comidas.": "Give the guests a gift in the previous chapter so they accept meals.",
  "Dar un regalo semanal a [[PID_ヨーカイ]] (2/3) y [[PID_ノクチュラ]] (1/4)": "Give a weekly gift to [[PID_ヨーカイ]] (2/3) and [[PID_ノクチュラ]] (1/4)",
  "Dar un regalo semanal a [[PID_ヨーカイ]] (2/3) y [[PID_ノクチュラ]] (1/4): son los reclutas más baratos de la ruta y crecen más cuanto antes entren.": "Give a weekly gift to [[PID_ヨーカイ]] (2/3) and [[PID_ノクチュラ]] (1/4): they are the route's cheapest recruits and grow more the earlier they join.",
