  "Despejar el [[封呪の祭壇]] para abrir el paso al [[黒翼の谷]], donde un mercader Vandahl cambia [[IID_デーツ]] y [[IID_巨大肉]]": "Clear the [[封呪の祭壇]] to open the way to [[黒翼の谷]], where a Vandahl merchant trades [[IID_デーツ]] and [[IID_巨大肉]]",
  "Despejar el [[封呪の祭壇]] para abrir el paso al [[黒翼の谷]], donde un mercader Vandahl cambia [[IID_デーツ]] y [[IID_巨大肉]].": "Clear the [[封呪の祭壇]] to open the way to [[黒翼の谷]], where a Vandahl merchant trades [[IID_デーツ]] and [[IID_巨大肉]].",
