  "Dividir el resto del ejército en dos escuadras con sanador propio para la final contra [[PID_ベルトラン]] y Castor": "Split the rest of the army into two squads, each with its own healer, for the final battle against [[PID_ベルトラン]] and Castor",
  "Dividir el resto del ejército en dos escuadras con sanador propio para la final contra [[PID_ベルトラン]] y Castor.": "Split the rest of the army into two squads, each with its own healer, for the final battle against [[PID_ベルトラン]] and Castor.",
