  "Mago": "Mage",
  "Magonius: 15 % Mag y 10 % Hab. Magonius negro: menos Mag y Hab pero 10 % Vel; en Caladrio empata con Vate en Mag y lo supera en 10 % Vel.": "Magonius: 15% Mag and 10% Dex. Black Magonius: less Mag and Dex but 10% Spd; on Caladrius it ties Ovate in Mag and beats it by 10% Spd.",
