  "Mapa del mundo: hasta 3 casillas por turno; parar antes consume el turno igual. Hablar o usar instalaciones no gasta turno, pero comprar algo cierra ese turno.": "World map: up to 3 spaces per turn; stopping early still uses up the turn. Talking or using facilities doesn't cost a turn, but buying something ends that turn.",
