  "Nagapedia indica que Sha Lan pide 2 de prestigio menos con Dietrich que con Leda, lo que matiza el prestigio 8 mínimo.": "Nagapedia states that Sha Lan requires 2 less Renown with Dietrich than with Leda, which qualifies the Renown 8 minimum.",
