  "Negocio propio de adivinación (ruta de Anatolia): 6 clientes; realeza 5 %, nobleza 20 %, pueblo 75 %; pagos 400/200/100; multiplicadores de 150 a 1000.": "Your own fortune-telling business (Anatolia's route): 6 customers; royalty 5%, nobility 20%, commoners 75%; payments 400/200/100; multipliers from 150 to 1,000.",
