  "Nezha: grupo de Anatolia, mucha Vel y Fue; Gladiador/Mirmidón.": "Nezha: Anatolia's group, high Spd and Str; Gladiator/Myrmidon.",
  "Niebla de guerra en Utopía; derrota a Zenzele. Aurora trae Curar, Recuperar, Fortificar y Teletransporte.": "Fog of war in Utopia; defeat Zenzele. Aurora brings Heal, Recover, Fortify and Warp.",
  "Niebla de guerra. En la esquina noroeste hay un cofre con Lingote; su llave la lleva un adivino cercano. Mata primero a los tres hechiceros que suben Def/Res a los enemigos cada turno.": "Fog of war. In the northwest corner there is a chest with a Bullion; a nearby fortune teller carries its key. First kill the three sorcerers who raise the enemies' Def/Res every turn.",
  "Ninae a Cai; Noctula a Dietrich; Nuzzuo a Theodora; Nydine a Cai; Seteth a Cai; Simon y Zarcone a Theodora.": "Ninae to Cai; Noctula to Dietrich; Nuzzuo to Theodora; Nydine to Cai; Seteth to Cai; Simon and Zarcone to Theodora.",
