  "No contar con dobles. Subir Golpe con Técnica entrenada (Guerrero), el Hacha de Da Mina y técnicas precisas.": "Don't count on doubles. Raise Hit with Practiced Art (Warrior), the Da Mina Axe, and accurate arts.",
  "No da +4 de VA: da +4 de Con, que sube la VA hasta 4. VA = Vel − máx(Peso total − Con, 0).": "It does not give +4 AS: it gives +4 Bld, which raises AS by up to 4. AS = Spd − max(total Wt − Bld, 0).",
