  "Reclutables: puntos naranjas, verdes tras hablarles; los invitados pueden ir a comidas.": "Recruitable units: orange dots, green after you talk to them; guests can attend Meals.",
  "Reclutada al final de la Parte 1, Esmeralda pierde de media 4,4 PV, 3,65 Fue, 1,75 Mag, 2,8 Vel, 2,6 Hab, 1,55 Def, 2,35 Res, 3,2 Sue y 3,25 Car: más de 25 puntos.": "Recruited at the end of Part 1, Esmeralda loses on average 4.4 HP, 3.65 Str, 1.75 Mag, 2.8 Spd, 2.6 Dex, 1.55 Def, 2.35 Res, 3.2 Lck and 3.25 Cha: over 25 points.",
  "Reclutamiento": "Recruitment",
  "Reclutamiento especial con arenga incluida, en algunas poblaciones desde el cap. 8; qué pueblos lo ofrecen, sin confirmar.": "Special recruitment with a speech included, in some settlements from ch. 8; which towns offer it is unconfirmed.",
  "Reclutamiento y aprendizajes, crecimientos y forja, atributos de reclutamiento, observaciones por capítulo, proyecciones de auto-nivel.": "Recruitment and learnsets, growths and forging, recruitment stats, per-chapter observations, auto-level projections.",
  "Reclutar = apoyo (regalos, comidas) + prestigio; algunos piden una misión. Hablarles una vez los añade al viaje rápido.": "Recruiting = support (gifts, meals) + Renown; some require a quest. Talking to them once adds them to fast travel.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (1/6) desde el 28 may": "Recruit [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (1/6) from May 28",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (1/6) desde el 28 may: en esta ruta solo pide apoyo 1.": "Recruit [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (1/6) from May 28: on this route she only asks for Support 1.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (3/8) tras su clasificatoria y reservar 5.000 G para [[PID_ジャスミン]] (3/9)": "Recruit [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (3/8) after her qualifier and set aside 5,000 G for [[PID_ジャスミン]] (3/9)",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (3/8) tras su clasificatoria y reservar 5.000 G para [[PID_ジャスミン]] (3/9).": "Recruit [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (3/8) after her qualifier and set aside 5,000 G for [[PID_ジャスミン]] (3/9).",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_イニオニ]] (1/7, 3.000 G) desde el 9 jul": "Recruit [[PID_イニオニ]] (1/7, 3,000 G) from Jul 9",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_イニオニ]] (1/7, 3.000 G) desde el 9 jul: aquí es más barata que en ninguna otra ruta.": "Recruit [[PID_イニオニ]] (1/7, 3,000 G) from Jul 9: he is cheaper here than on any other route.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6.000 G) desde el 9 jul y a [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (1/9, 2 [[IID_鉄の弓]])": "Recruit [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6,000 G) from Jul 9 and [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (1/9, 2 [[IID_鉄の弓]])",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6.000 G) desde el 9 jul y a [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (1/9, 2 [[IID_鉄の弓]]).": "Recruit [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6,000 G) from Jul 9 and [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (1/9, 2 [[IID_鉄の弓]]).",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6.000 G) y cerrar antes del 1 sep «Captura de ornius», «Flores de amor eterno» y «Entomófobo en apuros».": "Recruit [[PID_イニオニ]] (3/8, 6,000 G) and close “Request to Capture Orniuses”, “A Bouquet of Eternal Love” and “Helping a Bug Hater” before Sep 1.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_カターニャ]] en el reclutamiento guiado (apoyo 1, Prestigio 2)": "Recruit [[PID_カターニャ]] in the guided recruitment (Support 1, Renown 2)",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_カターニャ]] en el reclutamiento guiado (apoyo 1, Prestigio 2): empezar los regalos pronto, uno por semana.": "Recruit [[PID_カターニャ]] in the guided recruitment (Support 1, Renown 2): start the gifts early, one per week.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_グザラン]] en el reclutamiento guiado": "Recruit [[PID_グザラン]] in the guided recruitment",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_グザラン]] en el reclutamiento guiado: solo pide apoyo 1 y Prestigio 2.": "Recruit [[PID_グザラン]] in the guided recruitment: he only asks for Support 1 and Renown 2.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ゲイツ]] (3/10) cuando caiga el equipo de [[PID_ベルトラン]], si se hizo el desvío del 17 sep": "Recruit [[PID_ゲイツ]] (3/10) when [[PID_ベルトラン]]'s team falls, if the Sep 17 paralogue was done",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ゲイツ]] (3/10) cuando caiga el equipo de [[PID_ベルトラン]], si se hizo el desvío del 17 sep.": "Recruit [[PID_ゲイツ]] (3/10) when [[PID_ベルトラン]]'s team falls, if the Sep 17 paralogue was done.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ゴライアス]] (3/6, 3 [[IID_巨大肉]])": "Recruit [[PID_ゴライアス]] (3/6, 3 [[IID_巨大肉]])",
