  "Reclutar a [[PID_ジャスミン]] (1/8, 2.000 G) tras su combate del 7 may y a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (2/7) tras el del 28 may": "Recruit [[PID_ジャスミン]] (1/8, 2,000 G) after her battle on May 7 and [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (2/7) after hers on May 28",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ジャスミン]] (1/8, 2.000 G) tras su combate del 7 may y a [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (2/7) tras el del 28 may.": "Recruit [[PID_ジャスミン]] (1/8, 2,000 G) after her battle on May 7 and [[PID_アレキサンドラ]] (2/7) after hers on May 28.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ジャスミン]] (2/4, 500 G)": "Recruit [[PID_ジャスミン]] (2/4, 500 G)",
