  "Reclutar a [[PID_ソフィア]] en el reclutamiento guiado": "Recruit [[PID_ソフィア]] in the guided recruitment",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ソフィア]] en el reclutamiento guiado: es la mejor sanadora temprana y aquí no pide nada.": "Recruit [[PID_ソフィア]] in the guided recruitment: she is the best early healer and asks for nothing here.",
  "Reclutar a [[PID_ダイトウ]] (2/5) y a [[PID_ナジャ]] (2/6) en cuanto estén sus materiales": "Recruit [[PID_ダイトウ]] (2/5) and [[PID_ナジャ]] (2/6) as soon as their materials are ready",
