  "Reclutar a [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (3/9) con 3 [[IID_鉄の弓]] si hace falta otro tirador": "Recruit [[PID_ヌッツォ]] (3/9) with 3 [[IID_鉄の弓]] if another shooter is needed",
