  "Reclutar a [[PID_ミカエラ]] (3/5, 3.000 G) y a [[PID_マジーデ]] (2/5), disponible desde el 8 mar": "Recruit [[PID_ミカエラ]] (3/5, 3,000 G) and [[PID_マジーデ]] (2/5), available from Mar 8",
