  "Recoger la [[IID_砂虫肉]] de uno de los marcadores del pueblo antes de salir": "Pick up the [[IID_砂虫肉]] from one of the village markers before leaving",
  "Recoger la [[IID_砂虫肉]] de uno de los marcadores del pueblo antes de salir: no vuelve a aparecer.": "Pick up the [[IID_砂虫肉]] from one of the village markers before leaving: it does not appear again.",
