  "Smyrnos (30): +1 alcance mágico 1 turno, hasta nivel 2. Mar (30): PV al matar, +5 Fue, +50 Golpe. Credne es la peor.": "Smyrnos (30): +1 magic range for 1 turn, up to level 2. Mars (30): HP on kill, +5 Str, +50 Hit. Credna is the worst.",
  "Sobre Goliath hay desacuerdo: aquí se da casi imposible con Cai, pero Nagapedia lo asigna a Cai (solo 1 de prestigio más que Dietrich).": "There is disagreement about Goliath: here he is considered nearly impossible with Cai, but Nagapedia assigns him to Cai (only 1 Renown more than Dietrich).",
