  "Templo amarillo = 50 de prestigio. Clave para Dietrich (poco prestigio): tiene un recluta exclusivo difícil sin maximizarlo.": "Yellow Temple = 50 Renown. Key for Dietrich (low Renown): he has an exclusive recruit that is hard to get without maxing it.",
  "Templo brillando en amarillo = el dios quiere verte. La arena divina se recarga en cada misión principal. Una bendición da Gol +50 a ataques físicos 1 turno.": "Temple glowing yellow = the god wants to see you. Divine Sand recharges with each main quest. A blessing gives Hit +50 to physical attacks for 1 turn.",
